</div>
<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s271S">Another <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w54">example</span> would be the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w3">moon</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s271p2">in</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271r1">springtime</span>; <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w6">one</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w5">part</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w4">feel</span> of its rays on the body provides the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w8">material cause</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s271p9">and</span> then the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w12">karma</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s271p11">of</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w10">craving spirit</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w16">provides</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w14"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s271mc1">contributing</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s271m15">factor</span></span>. <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s271qdep1">Based on</span> these two, the spirit <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w27">gets</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w26">sensation</span> of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w25">heat</span>, which is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w24">experienced</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s271p23">by</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w20"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s271m22">consciousness</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s271m21">body</span></span>. So too with the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271r28">wintertime</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w29">sun</span>; <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w32">one</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w31">part</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w30">feel</span> of its rays on the body provides the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w34">material cause</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s271p35">and</span> then the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w38">karma</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s271p37">of</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w36">craving spirit</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w42">provides</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w40"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s271mc2">contributing</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s271m41">factor</span></span>. <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s271qdep2">Based on</span> these two, the spirit <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w53">gets</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w52">sensation</span> of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w51">cold</span>, which is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w50">experienced</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s271p49">by</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s271w46"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s271m48">consciousness</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s271m47">body</span></span>.<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s271p7"><span class="nul">Instrumental gis: no separate by/with exponent; the English presents the part as an active subject.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s271p13"><span class="nul">Instrumental kyis: karma is rendered as an active subject; no separate by/with word in this causal clause.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s271p33"><span class="nul">Instrumental gis: the English presents this part as an active subject, without a separate by/with exponent.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s271p39"><span class="nul">Instrumental kyis: active karma-subject syntax has no separate by/with word here.</span></span></span>
</div>
